                <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8f5e9, #f0f7f0); padding: 25px; border-radius: 15px; border-left: 5px solid var(--green-dark);">
                    <h3 style="color: var(--green-dark); font-family: Montserrat; margin-bottom: 15px;">🏢 Canal B2B</h3>
